To be used when the range of identities can be represented
as a numeric range (e.g., MSISDN ranges).""" ;
    rdfs:domain <urn:3gpp:sa5:_3gpp-5gc-nrm-nrffunction/msisdnRanges> ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .

<urn:3gpp:sa5:_3gpp-5gc-nrm-nrffunction/nfInfo/nfInstanceId> a rdf:Property ;
    rdfs:comment "String uniquely identifying a NF instance." ;
    rdfs:domain <urn:3gpp:sa5:_3gpp-5gc-nrm-nrffunction/nfInfo> ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .

<urn:3gpp:sa5:_3gpp-5gc-nrm-nrffunction/nfInfo/nfType> a rdf:Property ;
    rdfs:comment "This parameter defines type of Network Function" ;
    rdfs:domain <urn:3gpp:sa5:_3gpp-5gc-nrm-nrffunction/nfInfo> ;
    rdfs:range xsd:unsignedShort .

<urn:3gpp:sa5:_3gpp-5gc-nrm-nrffunction/pLMNInfoList/mcc> a rdf:Property ;
    rdfs:domain <urn:3gpp:sa5:_3gpp-5gc-nrm-nrffunction/pLMNInfoList> ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .

<urn:3gpp:sa5:_3gpp-5gc-nrm-nrffunction/pLMNInfoList/mnc> a rdf:Property ;
    rdfs:domain <urn:3gpp:sa5:_3gpp-5gc-nrm-nrffunction/pLMNInfoList> ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .

<urn:3gpp:sa5:_3gpp-5gc-nrm-nrffunction/pLMNInfoList/sd> a rdf:Property ;
    rdfs:comment """Slice Differentiator
If not needed, the value can be set to ff:ff:ff.""" ;
    rdfs:domain <urn:3gpp:sa5:_3gpp-5gc-nrm-nrffunction/pLMNInfoList> ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .

<urn:3gpp:sa5:_3gpp-5gc-nrm-nrffunction/pLMNInfoList/sst> a rdf:Property ;
    rdfs:comment """Slice/Service Type.
Values 0 to 127 belong to standardized SST range and are defined in
3GPP TS 23.501. Values 128 to 255 belong to operator-specific range.""" ;
    rdfs:domain <urn:3gpp:sa5:_3gpp-5gc-nrm-nrffunction/pLMNInfoList> ;
    rdfs:range xsd:unsignedByte .

